  "content_id": "16136183",
  "title": "Venmo Transactions Issues (via MoonPay)",
  "description": "Why Was My MoonPay Transaction Declined When Using Venmo?\nIf your MoonPay transaction was declined while using Venmo, it could be due to i...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My MoonPay Transaction Declined When Using Venmo?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your MoonPay transaction was declined while using Venmo, it could be due to issues with your Venmo balance, verification, or MoonPay’s payment processing filters. Here’s a quick overview of what might’ve gone wrong and how to fix it:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Insufficient Funds:</b> Your Venmo balance or linked funding source doesn’t have enough funds</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> Venmo or MoonPay account may be missing required verification</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Payment Method Issues:</b> Your Venmo-linked payment method (e.g. bank/card) may be unsupported or declined</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Purchase Limits:</b> You may have exceeded Venmo’s or MoonPay’s transaction limits</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Flag:</b> Transaction may have been auto-declined for risk or fraud prevention</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Confirm your Venmo balance and linked funding source have sufficient funds</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Make sure your Venmo and MoonPay accounts are fully verified</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try using a different Venmo-linked payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (and spam folder) for alerts from MoonPay or Venmo</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry the transaction after resolving any alerts or restrictions</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.moonpay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"> <b>Contact MoonPay Support</b></a><b>:https://support.moonpay.com/</b></p></li></ol>",
